{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 0, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 1, "text": "Wait, wait..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 2, "text": "Keep it quiet..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 3, "text": "Going further is dangerous."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 4, "text": "And, anyway..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 5, "text": "how did you get here?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 6, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 7, "text": "Um..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 8, "text": "The ring opens the right doors."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 9, "text": "I honestly don't know how it works."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 10, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 11, "text": "The ring?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 12, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 13, "text": "What's up with this place?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 14, "text": "It's super dark."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 15, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 16, "text": "I'll tell you later."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 17, "text": "For now, head towards the exit."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 18, "text": "You'll find an arcade machine. I'll be there."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 19, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 20, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 21, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 22, "text": "Hurry up, don't be tardy!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 23, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 24, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 25, "text": "// After mini-game"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 26, "text": "So? Got the point of the game?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 27, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 28, "text": "That I'm made of flesh and bone, and you have dummies inside you?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 29, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 30, "text": "Whoa!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 31, "text": "Sounds creepy when you say it like that."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 32, "text": "But that's how it is, I fear!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 33, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 34, "text": "Right, but why do I need this information?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 35, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 36, "text": "Think I was telling you that going further"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 37, "text": "was dangerous just for the lols?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 38, "text": "You'll run into those dummies there..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 39, "text": "The rejected ones. The \"faulty\" ones."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 40, "text": "They're very aggressive! Do you really want to deal with them?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 41, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 42, "text": "What other options do I have?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 43, "text": "I'll simply go through a door"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 44, "text": "whenever I see one."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 45, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 46, "text": "You're nuts!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 47, "text": "Then don't turn your back on them."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 48, "text": "And don't let them out of your sight!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 49, "text": "They get shy when you stare at them,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 50, "text": "so shy, in fact, that they freeze."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 51, "text": "Don't forget that!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 52, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 53, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 54, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 55, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 56, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 57, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 58, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 59, "text": "// Quest 1 (Why are there other Mitas down there?)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 60, "text": "They just got their skins."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 61, "text": "Now they need time"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 62, "text": "to gain a little more self-awareness."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 63, "text": "Then I'll need to bring each of them"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 64, "text": "to their own homes."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 65, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 66, "text": "// Quest 2 (Why is it so dark downstairs?)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 67, "text": "We Mitas are \"born\" in the dark,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 68, "text": "so we need to remain there for a while."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 69, "text": "Just imagine"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 70, "text": "the pain of moving from darkness straight into the light..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 71, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 72, "text": "// Quest 3 (What are you doing here?)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 73, "text": "Still don't get it?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 74, "text": "I'm helping the poor new Mitas settle in!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 75, "text": "Who will help them if I don't?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 76, "text": "You?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 77, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 78, "text": "// Quest 4 (Why do we need this conveyor?)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 79, "text": "Why are there so many Mitas being made?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 80, "text": "Is there enough room for everyone?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 81, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 82, "text": "Wait, don't tell me you don't"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 83, "text": "understand how this world works..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 84, "text": "And that it's infinite?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 85, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 86, "text": "Infinite?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 87, "text": "Uhm..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 88, "text": "What do you mean?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 89, "text": "If 1.9 is the latest version,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 90, "text": "there are only 19 worlds."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 91, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 92, "text": "My gosh, you really don't get"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 93, "text": "how this world works at all."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 94, "text": "Look, I'll use this blackboard"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 95, "text": "to explain it all to you."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 96, "text": "Want to hear about it?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 97, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 98, "text": "// Quest 5 (What is your version?)"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 99, "text": "I might be wrong, but..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 100, "text": "Didn't I meet you in the latest version?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 101, "text": "Or perhaps it was just my imagination."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 102, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 103, "text": "Well, it's quite possible!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 104, "text": "I'm from version 1.5."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 105, "text": "Have you been there?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 106, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 107, "text": "I have."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 108, "text": "That's where I first arrived"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 109, "text": "when I was thrown into this world!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 110, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 111, "text": "Whoa!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 112, "text": "But how...?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 113, "text": "I wonder which house index that was..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 114, "text": "There is a \"me\" who just can't stop whining,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 115, "text": "a \"me\" who loves horsing around,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 116, "text": "a \"me\" with bad memory and who likes to prank others..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 117, "text": "It's a long list..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 118, "text": "Do you recall anything?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 119, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 120, "text": "It was dark."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 121, "text": "There was writing..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 122, "text": "Something like..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 123, "text": "\"wanna play?\""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 124, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 125, "text": "Ah,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 126, "text": "what a bummer..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 127, "text": "It was that \"me\" after all."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 128, "text": "The forgetful prankster."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 129, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 130, "text": "// Mita wants to tell you [No]"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 131, "text": "Thanks but no thanks."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 132, "text": "I'll do fine on my own."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 133, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 134, "text": "Alright, suit yourself."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 135, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 136, "text": "// Mita wants to tell you [Yes]."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 137, "text": "Sure, go ahead."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 138, "text": "I just hope this won't be like high school"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 139, "text": "where I always fell asleep out of boredom."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 140, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 141, "text": "You can leave right now if you want."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 142, "text": "But if you're interested."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 143, "text": "here's how it works."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 144, "text": "A player downloads MiSide on their phone"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 145, "text": "and plays as much as they want."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 146, "text": "This way, they create a new house"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 147, "text": "and a new Mita."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 148, "text": "Here's a 2D representation."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 149, "text": "These are the versions,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 150, "text": "represented by vertical lines."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 151, "text": "The houses are placed on these lines."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 152, "text": "Let's say you download the version 1.14."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 153, "text": "This means a new life is created on that version:"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 154, "text": "a new Mita and her house."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 155, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 156, "text": "Heavens..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 157, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 158, "text": "You can ask about the details"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 159, "text": "shown in this drawing."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 160, "text": "I'll do my best to explain."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 161, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 162, "text": "// He asks about the only circle"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 163, "text": "Why does this version only have a single circle?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 164, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 165, "text": "Only one person played that version"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 166, "text": "and it isn't available anymore."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 167, "text": "That's why there's only one circle."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 168, "text": "The thing about versions like this"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 169, "text": "is that there are no other paths around them."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 170, "text": "Sleepy Mita resides in this version, 1.1."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 171, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 172, "text": "Sleepy?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 173, "text": "Because she never gets to sleep"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 174, "text": "with everyone walking through her version?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 175, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 176, "text": "No, that's not it."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 177, "text": "I could easily pass by her door,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 178, "text": "without even looking inside."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 179, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 180, "text": "// He asks about the shaded circle"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 181, "text": "Why is this circle shaded?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 182, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 183, "text": "Well, the whole reason this diagram is here        "}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 184, "text": "is because of Pretty Mita."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 185, "text": "She was the one who drew it."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 186, "text": "We were arguing over"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 187, "text": "the fastest way to reach version 1.11."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 188, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 189, "text": "So, who won?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 190, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 191, "text": "ME, of course!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 192, "text": "Look, this is where we are."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 193, "text": "Version 1.15,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 194, "text": "house index 809."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 195, "text": "We need to reach version 1.11,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 196, "text": "house index 805."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 197, "text": "Her initial path was like this."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 198, "text": "We tried to come up with a shorter one,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 199, "text": "and Pretty Mita suggested this path."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 200, "text": "And then I just showed her the simplest path."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 201, "text": "It's obvious if you think about it!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 202, "text": "Just look here."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 203, "text": "You can get directly to the version you want from the start."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 204, "text": "This house looks like it would block your path,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 205, "text": "but it's actually not in the way..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 206, "text": "By the way, your ring works based on the same principle."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 207, "text": "Where are you heading?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 208, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 209, "text": "The Core."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 210, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 211, "text": "The Core?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 212, "text": "Hmmm interesting..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 213, "text": "If you've been sent on the shortest path,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 214, "text": "you'll be going through version 1.11 too."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 215, "text": "You'll definitely encounter Sleepy Mita after that."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 216, "text": "I think the Mita who sent you"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 217, "text": "came up with the same path."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 218, "text": "Or maybe she didn't realize and you'll have to visit some other version."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 219, "text": "Or perhaps she's a genius"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 220, "text": "and came up with an even shorter path!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 221, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 222, "text": "I think I get it."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 223, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 224, "text": "// He asks about the inscription"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 225, "text": "What's this about?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 226, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 227, "text": "That's for Cool Mita."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 228, "text": "She'll be here in a few hours."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 229, "text": "She should move these boxes already"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 230, "text": "and place a sofa over there!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 231, "text": "My butt hurts, you know!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 232, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 233, "text": "Uhh..."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 234, "text": "Maybe I could help?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 235, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 236, "text": "No, that's Cool Mita's job."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 237, "text": "She has the strength for it."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 238, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 239, "text": "// He asks about the drawings"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 240, "text": "Is that a drawing,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 241, "text": "or "}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 242, "text": "does it mean something?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 243, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 244, "text": "Nah,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location10", "line_index": 245, "text": "it's just a doodle."}
